{"id":"f977c52fadb9a6ca","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-presburger-arithmetic.md","title":"Presburger Arithmetic","display":"df-presburger — Presburger Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-presburger-arithmetic","aliases":["57-df-presburger-arithmetic"],"display":"df-presburger — Presburger Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-presburger-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-presburger-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-presburger — Presburger Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Presburger-Arithmetic\">Presburger Arithmetic</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\)</span> 保留非逻辑符号集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,S,+,&lt;\\}\">\\(\\{0,S,+,&lt;\\}\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 为常量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一元函数、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 为二元函数、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 为二元关系。其完整字母表再并入固定变量与逻辑符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}\\)</span> 均取此完成字母表的视图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a> 的自然数集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 在本文件局部指下式的标准 Presburger 结构，而非任意载体为自然数的结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,&lt;\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,&lt;\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}=\\{0\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_1(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{S\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{+\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_2(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{&lt;\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Const}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}=\\{0\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_1(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{S\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{+\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_2(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{&lt;\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(S)\\coloneqq\\{(n,n+1):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(+)\\coloneqq\\{((m,n),m+n):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(&lt;)\\coloneqq\\{(m,n)\\in\\mathbb N^2:m&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(S)\\coloneqq\\{(n,n+1):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(+)\\coloneqq\\{((m,n),m+n):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(&lt;)\\coloneqq\\{(m,n)\\in\\mathbb N^2:m&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,I_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PresburgerTheory}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}:\\mathfrak N\\models\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak N\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,I_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PresburgerTheory}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}:\\mathfrak N\\models\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N,S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N)=\\mathrm{PresburgerTheory}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N,S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N)=\\mathrm{PresburgerTheory}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准自然数的运算和序直接给出；不再把任意 Presburger 语言结构的理论都称为标准 Presburger 算术。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Presburger-Arithmetic","text":"Presburger Arithmetic","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}$ 保留非逻辑符号集 $\\{0,S,+,<\\}$：$0$ 为常量、$S$ 为一元函数、$+$ 为二元函数、$<$ 为二元关系。其完整字母表再并入固定变量与逻辑符号，$\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}$ 均取此完成字母表的视图。$\\mathbb N$ 为 [[57-df-omega]] 的自然数集；$\\mathfrak N$ 在本文件局部指下式的标准 Presburger 结构，而非任意载体为自然数的结构。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,S,+,<\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,<\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}=\\{0\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_1(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{S\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{+\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_2(S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})=\\{<\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(S)\\coloneqq\\{(n,n+1):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(+)\\coloneqq\\{((m,n),m+n):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\nI_{\\mathrm{Pres}}(<)\\coloneqq\\{(m,n)\\in\\mathbb N^2:m<n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbb N,I_{\\mathrm{Pres}}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PresburgerTheory}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{Pres}}}:\\mathfrak N\\models\\varphi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N,S_{\\mathrm{Pres}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N)=\\mathrm{PresburgerTheory}.","display":true}],"bytes":1922,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarch